<!-- LAYOUT CONTRACT
     SPINE     x=1540..1920
     LEFT_COL  x=660..980
     SUBAGENTS x=2480..3040
     BLOCKED   x=2480..2840 (bottom)

     BUSES (exclusive; long-haul must miss every solid vertex AABB):
       x=480  repair → blocked descent
       x=520  awaiting → END
       x=560  explain → END
       x=600  review_fix climb
       x=1080 findings
       x=1180 repair ↔ verify
       x=1440 fan-out bypass (west of purple regions)
       x=2100 advisory (west of drain; east of fan-out frames)
       x=2220 blocked drain
       y=10   blocked top runway (above all nodes)
       y=1960 / 1995 staggered re-verify collectors
       y=3080 repair → blocked bottom

     Typography: phase boxes use framework style (no spacingTop/Bottom).
     Region titles are separate cells above empty dashed frames.
     Fan-out stack cards are illustration; join edges use x=1440 bypass.
-->
